    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459940/extras/f905e69bfa63f13474ac799cfc67cac4.poster.avif?t=1752088310\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459940/extras/f905e69bfa63f13474ac799cfc67cac4.webm?t=1752088310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459940/extras/f905e69bfa63f13474ac799cfc67cac4.mp4?t=1752088310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duck's Hunt</strong> is a fast paced hardcore FPS game where you play as a bloodthirsty duck. <br><br>No health bars. No reloads. It\u2019s just you and the gun you snatched from the enemy. One hit and you\u2019re out. There are no convenient save points. When you die, you are back to the start of the level. Learn from your mistakes to achieve a flawless\u00a0victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459940/extras/26906bd55a19ea12994c2acd525ec9f1.poster.avif?t=1752088310\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459940/extras/26906bd55a19ea12994c2acd525ec9f1.webm?t=1752088310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459940/extras/26906bd55a19ea12994c2acd525ec9f1.mp4?t=1752088310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alright, it's go-time! Grab the keys, jump in and take off for a quick spin around the neighborhood! Just a heads-up though the roads might be a little... <i>unpredictable</i>, shall we say so hold on tight and get ready for a bumpy, but fun ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459940/extras/6897efe395ad368b7e57d14e07d6b57b.poster.avif?t=1752088310\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459940/extras/6897efe395ad368b7e57d14e07d6b57b.webm?t=1752088310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459940/extras/6897efe395ad368b7e57d14e07d6b57b.mp4?t=1752088310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guns can fail, ammo can run out and sometimes, the only way to survive is to return to a more primitive method. When all else fails, engage in brutal melee combat and leave your enemies in the dust!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459940/extras/2f0146b115a87cff19c4fbfc5950a221.poster.avif?t=1752088310\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459940/extras/2f0146b115a87cff19c4fbfc5950a221.webm?t=1752088310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459940/extras/2f0146b115a87cff19c4fbfc5950a221.mp4?t=1752088310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget subtle strategies, it's time for a full-blown, over-the-top pyrotechnic extravaganza! Turn every battlefield into a fireworks show! You\u2019ll send your enemies flying with a blaze of glory, whether through a well-aimed rocket or an accidental chain of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duck's Hunt Features</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action-packed Levels </strong>- Dive into action-packed scenarios each filled with unique enemies and weapons.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Arsenal </strong>- Use what you want whether that be traditional firearms, explosives or common household objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactable Objects </strong>- If you see it, you can use it in some way or the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Mode</strong> - Replay without saves, the bigger the risk greater the fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong> - Last as long as you can against waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duck's Hunt</strong> offers players a unique gaming experience featuring a humorous single-player campaign and unconventional gameplay. The game's clear visuals help players focus on the gameplay and the action driven missions.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459940/extras/f905e69bfa63f13474ac799cfc67cac4.poster.avif?t=1752088310\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459940/extras/f905e69bfa63f13474ac799cfc67cac4.webm?t=1752088310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459940/extras/f905e69bfa63f13474ac799cfc67cac4.mp4?t=1752088310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duck's Hunt</strong> is a fast paced hardcore FPS game where you play as a bloodthirsty duck. <br><br>No health bars. No reloads. It\u2019s just you and the gun you snatched from the enemy. One hit and you\u2019re out. There are no convenient save points. When you die, you are back to the start of the level. Learn from your mistakes to achieve a flawless\u00a0victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459940/extras/26906bd55a19ea12994c2acd525ec9f1.poster.avif?t=1752088310\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459940/extras/26906bd55a19ea12994c2acd525ec9f1.webm?t=1752088310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459940/extras/26906bd55a19ea12994c2acd525ec9f1.mp4?t=1752088310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alright, it's go-time! Grab the keys, jump in and take off for a quick spin around the neighborhood! Just a heads-up though the roads might be a lit